WEBVTT

00:01.080 --> 00:04.467
I said only talk about family matters.

00:09.760 --> 00:11.427
I just miss your sister.

00:19.040 --> 00:23.720
Your Majesty's family matters are state matters Your Majesty is now of priceless worth.

00:23.800 --> 00:28.680
Can still remember sister's affection I am deeply grateful.

00:38.040 --> 00:41.280
My sister was the family's treasure since childhood.

00:42.000 --> 00:47.800
The elders all praised her cleverness and gentleness unaware of affairs but actually my sister.

00:47.960 --> 00:53.680
Was thoughtful and had strong opinions when I was young I often got into trouble.

00:53.760 --> 00:58.000
When I couldn't cover it up I'd go beg my sister my sister.

00:58.080 --> 01:00.080
Could always fix it for me.

